---
source: tests/cli_golden.rs
expression: help
---
Export runs as `train.jsonl` / `eval.jsonl` plus a dataset card

Usage: aura dataset build [OPTIONS] --format <FORMAT>

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          `sft`, `preference`, `rl` or `harness-bandit`

      --mode <MODE>
          Session mode for the desktop window or terminal. Overrides the daemon default (`AURA_DEFAULT_MODE`); the kernel denies any tool call the mode does not allow

          Possible values:
          - agent: Full unrestricted operation subject to user permissions
          - plan:  Read + markdown writes + read-only subprocesses
          - ask:   Read-only
          - debug: Read + sandboxed probes only

      --filter <FILTER>
          Comma-separated filter, e.g. `outcome>=0.5,model=claude-opus-4-6`
          
          [default: ]

      --out <OUT>
          Output directory (default `AURA_HOME/datasets/<format>`)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
